---
const principles = [
  ['01', 'Position', 'The market does not need more accurate descriptions. It needs one clear way to understand why your judgement matters.'],
  ['02', 'Proof', 'The strongest record is usually already there. The work is retrieving it, framing it, and earning permission to use it.'],
  ['03', 'Package', 'A named method gives private expertise a form other people can repeat, reference, and carry into rooms you do not enter.'],
  ['04', 'Platform', 'The right signal belongs in the right rooms. A quieter distribution plan is often the more credible one.'],
];
const fits = [
  'You have built something substantial and need the market to understand the judgment behind it.',
  'You care more about the quality of the rooms than the size of the audience.',
  'You are willing to take a position rather than publish a biography.',
];
---

<section class="ps-hero">
  <picture class="ps-hero__image"><source media="(max-width: 700px)" srcset="/images/private-signal-hero-mobile.webp" /><source media="(max-width: 1200px)" srcset="/images/private-signal-hero@1280.webp" /><img src="/images/private-signal-hero.webp" alt="Conceptual executive adviser in a private library" width="1920" height="1080" fetchpriority="high" /></picture>
  <div class="ps-hero__veil"></div>
  <div class="ps-hero__top"><span>Raghavan Advisory</span><span>Private Signal</span><span>San Francisco / Global</span></div>
  <div class="ps-hero__copy">
    <p class="ps-kicker"><i></i> Executive authority advisory</p>
    <h1>CAPABLE<br />IS A PRIVATE<br /><em>FACT.</em></h1>
    <p class="ps-hero__lede">Authority is what remains when you leave the room. I work with founders and senior operators whose judgement deserves a clearer, more consequential public life.</p>
    <div class="ps-actions"><a href="/contact/">Request a private conversation <b>↗</b></a><a href="#method" class="ps-actions__secondary">See how the work unfolds <b>↓</b></a></div>
    <div class="ps-hero__note"><span>Private work / selected engagements</span><p>A considered process for leaders whose record is stronger than their current signal.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="ps-hero__number">01 <span>THE PRIVATE SIGNAL</span></div>
</section>

<section class="ps-thesis">
  <div class="ps-thesis__intro"><p class="ps-kicker"><i></i> The tension</p><h2>YOUR MOST<br />IMPORTANT WORK<br />SHOULD NOT LIVE<br /><em>ONLY IN YOUR<br />HEAD.</em></h2></div>
  <div class="ps-thesis__body"><p>There is a particular kind of successful person who is still easy to underestimate. They can lead the meeting, repair the situation, make the difficult decision—and then watch a louder, simpler story travel further.</p><p>The answer is not a louder version of you. It is a more deliberate way to make your judgement tangible.</p><a href="/about/">Read the record <span>↗</span></a></div>
  <div class="ps-thesis__aside"><span>THE QUIET COST</span><p>When the market cannot read the difference, it defaults to a cheaper, louder, or more familiar story.</p></div>
</section>

<section id="method" class="ps-method">
  <div class="ps-method__image"><img src="/images/private-signal-artifact.webp" alt="A conceptual strategic method diagram on stationery" width="1920" height="1440" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="ps-method__content"><p class="ps-kicker"><i></i> The Quiet Authority Method</p><h2>MAKE THE<br />INVISIBLE<br /><em>LEGIBLE.</em></h2><p class="ps-method__lede">A four-part process that turns lived judgement into a position, a proof library, a point of view, and a presence that can survive without you in the room.</p><div class="ps-method__list">{principles.map(([number, title, copy]) => <article><span>{number}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></div></article>)}</div><a class="ps-method__link" href="/method/">Explore the method in full <b>↗</b></a></div>
</section>

<section class="ps-work">
  <div class="ps-work__copy"><p class="ps-kicker"><i></i> The working view</p><h2>NOT A<br />PERSONAL<br /><em>BRAND.</em><br />A PRIVATE<br />OPERATING<br />SYSTEM.</h2><p>The work is not to make you perform a more polished version of yourself. It is to find the intellectual property already embedded in your decisions, name it with care, and build the assets that let the right people recognize it.</p><a href="/work-with-me/">See the ways we can work together <b>↗</b></a></div>
  <picture class="ps-work__image"><source media="(max-width: 800px)" srcset="/images/private-signal-working@960.webp" /><img src="/images/private-signal-working.webp" alt="Conceptual adviser mapping a strategic method at a private table" width="1920" height="1280" loading="lazy" /></picture>
</section>

<section class="ps-standard">
  <div><p class="ps-kicker"><i></i> The standard</p><h2>PROOF WITH<br /><em>PERMISSION.</em></h2></div>
  <div class="ps-standard__copy"><p>Good work is often confidential. That does not mean a website needs to borrow authority from invented logos, anonymous statistics, or generic praise. It means the public record has to be made with more care.</p><p>Every case, result, quotation, and name in a live client site is either permissioned, responsibly anonymized, or left out. The website becomes more credible because of what it refuses to claim.</p><a href="/case-studies/">See the case-study standard <span>↗</span></a></div>
</section>

<section class="ps-fit">
  <div class="ps-fit__image"><img src="/images/private-signal-close.webp" alt="Conceptual editorial portrait of an executive adviser" width="1200" height="1500" loading="lazy" /></div>
  <div class="ps-fit__content"><p class="ps-kicker"><i></i> A considered fit</p><h2>THE RIGHT<br />ROOMS.<br /><em>THE RIGHT<br />SIGNAL.</em></h2><p>This is a focused collaboration for people who have a meaningful record, want a public position equal to it, and prefer thoughtful work over ambient visibility.</p><ul>{fits.map((item) => <li><b>—</b>{item}</li>)}</ul><a href="/contact/">Begin with the diagnostic <b>↗</b></a></div>
</section>

<section class="ps-notes"><p>Private Signal is a premium AURA concept direction. In a live client build, imagery is created through the documented consent-led photo system and every public claim is supported by the client’s approved evidence register.</p><a href="/blog/">Read the field notes <b>↗</b></a></section>

